# MODE CERTIFICATE: maximum_relative_halfwidth 1e-7, as on the E4 cards; origin's default certificate refuses this bar's 9-window plan in window 8 of 9 (7782.2 to 8891.1 Hz), the mode at 8867.313 Hz carrying a relative half-width of 1.16e-8 (FS-MODAL-HALFWIDTH-EXCEEDED). At 1e-7 the widest certificate of the band's 15 modes is 5.1e-5 Hz, on the mode at 8867.313 Hz, that mode itself. It sets no sound.
maximum_relative_halfwidth	1e-7
